{"id":"00f2d4c2761196f9","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-csima-montalban-gap.md","title":"Csima–Montalbán的K平凡间隙函数","display":"thm-csima-montalban-gap — Csima–Montalbán的K平凡间隙函数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-csima-montalban-gap","aliases":["43-thm-csima-montalban-gap"],"display":"thm-csima-montalban-gap — Csima–Montalbán的K平凡间隙函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-ktrivial]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 15.9.1; printed pp.477–478 / PDF pp.497–498","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-csima-montalban-gap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-csima-montalban-gap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-csima-montalban-gap — Csima–Montalbán的K平凡间隙函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 15.9.1; printed pp.477–478 / PDF pp.497–498"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivial}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 不预设可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,n,b\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(N,n,b\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\forall n\\;f(n)\\le f(n+1)\\land\\forall b\\;\\exists n\\;f(n)&gt;b\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)\\iff\\exists N\\;\\forall n\\ge N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+f(n)\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\forall n\\;f(n)\\le f(n+1)\\land\\forall b\\;\\exists n\\;f(n)&gt;b\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)\\iff\\exists N\\;\\forall n\\ge N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+f(n)\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该函数单调无界却足够慢，允许把固定平凡常数放宽为同一个f而不扩大序列类。不能把f称为可计算阶函数；书末仅说明分析证明可取Δ⁰₄，当前断言只用存在性。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 15.9.1; printed pp.477–478 / PDF pp.497–498。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$ 与 $K$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 不预设可计算；$N,n,b\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$ 与 $K$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 不预设可计算；$N,n,b\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivial}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N,n,b\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\forall n\\;f(n)\\le f(n+1)\\land\\forall b\\;\\exists n\\;f(n)>b\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)\\iff\\exists N\\;\\forall n\\ge N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+f(n)\\right]\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1610,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-408","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-csima-montalban-gap]] — Csima–Montalbán的K平凡间隙函数"}],"outgoing":["ccd45302acc926e6","6cd902d852c2c848"]}